@startuml 12-state-refresh-token
title State - Refresh token (one link of a session family)
skinparam shadowing false

[*] --> Active : issued at sign-in\nor by a refresh
Active --> Used : POST /auth/refresh\n/ next token issued (same family)
Active --> Expired : REFRESH_TOKEN_TTL_DAYS passed
Active --> Revoked : sign-out, or reuse\ndetected in the family
Used --> Revoked : presented again (replay)\n/ whole family revoked
Expired --> [*]
Revoked --> [*]
Used --> [*]

Active : stored only as a SHA-256 hash
Used : must never be presented again
@enduml
